**Actual cleanest fix:** Override `CallAction.Children()` to return `[parameters..., returns...]` instead of `[Callee, returns...]`. The `AstCallee.Terms` field has the parameters. But we need to also keep `ActionArgs()` unchanged for Clone semantics.

